          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.378,
            0.886,
            0.441
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "*7. Draw the graph of the following equations, and identify their slopes and y-intercepts. Also, find the coordinates of the points where these lines cut the y-axis."
